  "properties": {
    "title": "QField 3 - Fieldwork redefined",
    "description": "Discover QField, the professional mobile data collection app for QGIS with over 1 million downloads and 350K active users. Recognized as a Digital Public Good, QField supports essential UN Sustainable Development Goals, such as Clean Water, Sustainable Cities, Climate Action, and Life on Land. \r\n\r\nThis powerful tool combines minimal design with advanced technology, enabling intuitive data viewing and editing. Seamlessly synchronized with QFieldCloud, it ensures efficient and pleasant fieldwork sessions. \r\n\r\nJoin us to explore how QField 3 can redefine your fieldwork, making it more effective and impactful for addressing both daily tasks and global challenges.",
